# Mirkwood Nurturer: "return up to one other target permanent you control to its owner's hand" - any permanent, a land too. Bot1 pays
# for the Nurturer with a Forest and two Moxen on turn 1 and returns the tapped Forest to its hand; the Nurturer is a 4/3.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mirkwood Nurturer
Swamp x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
